# 🇮🇳 UPI Fraud Detection AI

A machine learning-powered web application to detect fraudulent UPI (Unified Payments Interface) transactions in real-time. Built with Streamlit and trained on bank-grade realistic transaction data.

## 📋 Table of Contents

- [Overview](#overview)
- [Features](#features)
